    "description": "<section class=\"hol-item-reference\"><p class=\"hol-automation-label\"><strong>Automation:</strong> Rules reference · resolve effects at the table</p><div class=\"hol-reference-flavor\"><p>You breathe out slowly. Your companion&#39;s chest rises with renewed strength as yours catches on the effort.</p></div><h2>Rules</h2><dl class=\"hol-reference-details\"><div><dt>Action</dt><dd>Main Action</dd></div><div><dt>Attribute</dt><dd>Reason</dd></div><div><dt>Target / range / shape</dt><dd>One willing creature within 3 squares, including yourself, or one creature in range harmed by healing.</dd></div><div><dt>Type</dt><dd>Magic / Recovery</dd></div></dl><div class=\"hol-reference-rules\"><p>Pay 1 HP and make a Reason healing roll.</p><dl class=\"hol-reference-outcomes\"><dt>Weak</dt><dd>Restore 3 HP.</dd><dt>Standard</dt><dd>Restore 6 HP.</dd><dt>Strong</dt><dd>Restore 9 HP.</dd></dl></div><p class=\"hol-reference-source\"><strong>Source:</strong> <a href=\"https://github.com/bruceamoser/heroes-of-legend/blob/f3fb98ca03b046335fcc730c1b05689bebf091b4/design/cards/shared-breath.md\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">design/cards/shared-breath.md</a> at <code>f3fb98ca03b046335fcc730c1b05689bebf091b4</code>.</p></section>",
